<div class="c"><h1 class="redstar">Poetry By:Dave Packard</h1></div><h2 class="c">Ode to Billy</h2><p>Billy is grand,<br>he's a wonderful fellow,<br>but he may whip your *ss,<br>if you tell him he's yellow.<br><br>He's always polite,<br>he hardly ever gets sh*tty,<br>and on the opposite side,<br>he is always quite witty.<br><br>I am his cousin,<br>and of that I am proud,<br>I think he's the king,<br>and I shout it out loud.<br><br>He's as tough as a tiger,<br>he's as strong as a bear,<br>but he's also a puppy.<br>(with grand facial hair)<br><br>I am almost all done,<br>only a paragraph to go,<br>to sum up my thoughts,<br>for a more than average Joe.<br><br>I really love my cousin,<br>I think he's a genius!<br>but the ladies like him,<br>cause he has a large heart.<br><br><br><br><br><br></p><hr width="50%" class="redstar"></body>
